### Seed Client lunch for the stale-second conflict pair
POST {{ExpenseSync.Api_HostAddress}}/pushChanges
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "device-02",
  "changes": [
    {
      "pendingChangeId": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "expenseId": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "operation": "Create",
      "capturedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T13:00:00Z",
      "expense": {
        "description": "Client lunch",
        "amount": 48.75,
        "expenseDate": "2026-11-10",
        "lastModifiedUtc": "2026-11-10T13:00:00Z"
      }
    }
  ]
}

