### Audit-only push
POST {{ExpenseSync.Api_HostAddress}}/pushChanges
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "device-02",
  "changes": [],
  "auditEntries": [
    {
      "auditEntryId": "d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "expenseId": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "operation": "Update",
      "occurredAtUtc": "2026-11-10T15:00:00Z",
      "deviceId": "device-02",
      "userId": "user-02",
      "details": "Amount 48.75 -> 55.00"
    }
  ]
}

